{"repositoryId":1302640925,"availability":"available","full":"TariqHusainKhan/Multi-Agent-AI-Research-System-with-LangChain","name":"Multi-Agent-AI-Research-System-with-LangChain","description":"Multi-agent AI research system — ReAct agents for search & scraping, LCEL pipelines for writing & self-critique. Built with LangChain, LangGraph, Tavily, and Gemini. Live Streamlit demo included.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-16T10:22:18Z","updated":"2026-07-21T12:13:30Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://multi-agent-research-ai.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai-agents","gemini-api","langchain","langgraph","llm","llmops","multi-agent-systems","python","rag","react-agent","streamlit"],"demo":"https://multi-agent-research-ai.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.744Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.744Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.744Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.744Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A multi-agent AI system that autonomously researches any topic — searching the web, scraping sources for deeper context, drafting a structured report, and critiquing its own output — built with LangChain, LangGraph, and LCEL (Runnables).","🔗 Live Demo: [Add your Streamlit Cloud URL here]","Most \"AI chatbot\" projects are a single LLM call wrapped in a UI. This project is different: it's a coordinated system of specialized agents, each with its own tools and responsibility, that hand off work to one another to produce a finished, reviewed research report from a single topic query."],"features":["Two specialized ReAct agents (createagent from LangGraph) — a search agent that queries the web and a reader agent that scrapes and reads full-page content, each restricted to its own tool.","Custom tools built from scratch — websearch (Tavily API) and scrapeurl (BeautifulSoup + requests), both implemented as LangChain @tool-decorated functions rather than pre-built wrappers.","LCEL (LangChain Expression Language) pipelines — the writer and critic stages use pure prompt | llm | outputparser Runnable chains instead of legacy Chain classes, keeping the data flow explicit and composable.","Self-critiquing output — a dedicated critic agent scores the generated report and gives structured, actionable feedback, rather than treating the first draft as final.","Interactive Streamlit UI — a clean web interface for entering a topic and viewing the report, critique, and raw research data in separate tabs, with a Markdown download option."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TariqHusainKhan/Multi-Agent-AI-Research-System-with-LangChain/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"af604c323e1dd746d4c8d4a370ebd61d292d957a0f7ad293e565bab2a39472e4","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.826Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.826Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A multi-agent AI system that autonomously researches any topic — searching the web, scraping sources for deeper context, drafting a structured report, and critiquing its own output — built with LangChain, LangGraph, and LCEL (Runnables).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TariqHusainKhan/Multi-Agent-AI-Research-System-with-LangChain/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"af604c323e1dd746d4c8d4a370ebd61d292d957a0f7ad293e565bab2a39472e4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TariqHusainKhan/Multi-Agent-AI-Research-System-with-LangChain/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.826Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-21T12:13:30Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TariqHusainKhan/Multi-Agent-AI-Research-System-with-LangChain/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.826Z","hash":"af604c323e1dd746d4c8d4a370ebd61d292d957a0f7ad293e565bab2a39472e4","originalBytes":5926,"storedBytes":5926,"truncat